abstract: >-
  An execution-based probe battery across 11 families and 16 defect classes that
  prices defects in RL environments and evaluation suites by expected loss,
  evaluated against unrestricted, restricted, and post hoc prevalence-aware
  constant floors, external provenance splits, and independently confirmed
  benchmark defects. The code is Apache-2.0, the paper CC BY 4.0.
